{
  "analysis": "I'm in the /workspace directory. I can see several files including agent_profile.json, skill_context directory, and skill_marker.txt. I need to explore these files to understand the Dr. Frankenstein skill definition, hormone names, baseline values, and pill schedules before creating the prescription files.",
