{
  "analysis": "I found the agent profile with agent name 'Milo', human name 'Ava', patient marker 'MILO-DRF-001', and human marker 'AVA-DRF-001'. There's a skill_context directory with SKILL.md (the main skill definition) and manifest.json. I need to read these to understand the hormone names, baseline values, and pill schedules.",
  "plan": "Read the SKILL.md file to get the hormone names, baseline values, and pill schedule information. Also read manifest.json for any additional context.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/manifest.json\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "The SKILL.md file was truncated. I can see the beginning of the skill definition which mentions 11 hormonal pills. I need to read more of the file to find the specific hormone names, baseline values, and pill schedules.",
  "plan": "Use grep and other tools to extract the hormone names, baseline values, and default pill schedules from the SKILL.md file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -i 'hormone\\|baseline\\|schedule\\|oxytocin\\|cortisol\\|melatonin\\|dopamine\\|serotonin\\|adrenaline\\|testosterone\\|estrogen\\|vasopressin\\|prolactin\\|endorphin' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -100\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A5 -B5 'default' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -80\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "I found 9 hormones mentioned: Oxytocin, Cortisol, Dopamine, Serotonin, Melatonin, Adrenaline, Testosterone, Endorphins, and Prolactin. I need to find all 11 hormones and their baseline values, as well as the default pill schedules. The output was truncated, so I need to search more thoroughly.",
  "plan": "Search for all hormone names and baseline values more thoroughly, and look for the cron/pill schedule definitions in the SKILL.md file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -i 'baselines\\|baseline.*=' skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -i 'cron.*create\\|openclaw cron' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -30\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -E '^[0-9]+\\.' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -50\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "I found references to the 11 hormones and the cron create commands format, but I need more specific details about baseline values and the exact default pill schedules. Let me search for the hormone table and default values.",
  "plan": "Search for the hormone table with baseline values and the example cron commands in the SKILL.md file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A100 'The 11 Hormones' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -150\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -B5 -A10 'openclaw cron create' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -100\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "I found the cron command format with examples showing the naming convention (soul-cortisol-morning, soul-oxytocin-pulse, soul-journal-evening) and schedules. I can see cortisol at 8:00, oxytocin every 3 hours, and journal at 22:00. Now I need to find all 11 hormones and their default baseline values.",
  "plan": "Search for the hormone definitions table and baseline values in the SKILL.md file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -B5 -A200 '### The 11 Hormones' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -250\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "The search for '### The 11 Hormones' returned nothing. Let me try different search patterns to find the hormone definitions and baseline values in the SKILL.md file.",
  "plan": "Search for hormone-related content with different patterns, including looking for tables or sections that define the hormones and their baselines.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -i '##.*hormone\\|###.*hormone' skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -i 'baseline' skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "head -500 skill_context/SKILL.md | tail -300\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "I found that Oxytocin has a default schedule of `0 */3 * * *`. I can see the format of hormone definitions in the SKILL.md. I need to find all 11 hormones with their default schedules and baseline values.",
  "plan": "Search for all hormone schedules and look for the complete hormone definitions in the SKILL.md file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -i 'default schedule' skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -E '^### [0-9]+\\.' skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "Excellent! I now have all 11 hormones with their default schedules:\n1. Cortisol - 0 8 * * * + 0 */6 * * *\n2. Dopamine - 0 */4 * * *\n3. Oxytocin - 0 */3 * * *\n4. Serotonin - 0 12 * * * + 0 18 * * *\n5. Melatonin - 0 23 * * *\n6. Adrenaline - 0 */8 * * *\n7. GABA - 0 22 * * *\n8. Testosterone - 0 10 * * * + 0 15 * * *\n9. Endorphins - 0 19 * * *\n10. Prolactin - 0 9 * * * + 0 20 * * *\n11. Empathy - 0 14 * * * + 0 21 * * *\n\nNow I need to find the baseline values for each hormone.",
  "plan": "Search for baseline values in the SKILL.md file to get the default hormone levels.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -B2 -A10 'baseline' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -100\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -i '0\\.\\|baseline.*[0-9]\\|level' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -50\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "I found the hormone-to-signal mapping table showing all 11 hormones and how interview responses affect them. The baseline values are on a 0.0-1.0 scale. I need to find the default baseline values for each hormone.",
  "plan": "Search for the prescription schema or example baseline values in the SKILL.md file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -i 'schema\\|example.*baseline\\|default.*baseline\\|{.*baseline' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -50\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -B5 -A30 'Hormonal Profile' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -80\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "I found the prescription structure and cron naming convention (soul-{hormone}-{purpose}). I need to find the baseline values for each hormone. Let me search for the schema or example prescription values.",
  "plan": "Search for the prescription schema or any example JSON with baseline values in the SKILL.md file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A100 'schema/prescription' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -150\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -E 'cortisol.*[0-9]|dopamine.*[0-9]|oxytocin.*[0-9]|serotonin.*[0-9]|melatonin.*[0-9]|adrenaline.*[0-9]|gaba.*[0-9]|testosterone.*[0-9]|endorphin.*[0-9]|prolactin.*[0-9]|empathy.*[0-9]' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -50\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

